Here is the root cause:
The root cause of the bug is the incorrect addition of TDM hardware configurations in the device tree for the VisionFive 2 board, which does not actually include TDM hardware. This led to conflicts with other device nodes, specifically the I2S node, due to both attempting to claim the same GPIO pin (GPIO 44). The TDM configurations were unnecessary and created a situation where the system could not properly allocate resources for the I2S functionality.

